  m_Name: PlaceExplainDial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RSDialogueObj
  line:
  - Its time to put the cards you made to action
  - Your cards will fight against cards drawn by your opponent (oooo exciting!)
  - Drag and drop a card to play them
  - Then choose a card to clash with
  - 'Pay attention to abilities, '
  - and play cards strategically to maximize power bonuses
  - Win every opponent's card to complete the round
  - 68% of wins are made by people with big brains.
  - I hope you are one of the smart ones
